cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use iReview, please cite it as below."
title: "iReview: AI-to-AI code review with I-Lang v5.0 vector judgment"
abstract: >-
  iReview replaces English prose between models with a protocol. The calling
  agent sends an I-Lang operation chain describing what to review, and the
  reviewing model returns I-Lang declarations: one record per finding with
  file, line, severity and confidence. Severity comes from the v5.0 judgment
  vector rather than keyword matching. It works with any OpenAI-compatible
  model, supports standard and adversarial modes and multi-model chains, and
  needs only Git, Bash and Python 3.
type: software
authors:
